        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-114044",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For applications where access to such infrastructure is unavailable, we also offer a secure cloud based PACS where healthcare professionals, including teleradiology service providers, can view images from anywhere in the world.",
        "start_character": 52859,
        "end_character": 53086
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-114044",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-114044-99dd25c7964d93b4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-114044",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, as we expand internationally subject to regulatory authorization in those countries, we will continue to leverage distributors to sell our product depending on the commercial strategy for each country assessed on a country-by-country basis.",
        "start_character": 65287,
        "end_character": 65536
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-114044",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-114044-99dd25c7964d93b4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-114044",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our point-of-care MRI systems have been classified and are regulated as Class II devices, although future products that we develop may be classified as Class III devices.",
        "start_character": 88851,
        "end_character": 89021
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-114044",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-114044-99dd25c7964d93b4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-114044",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our research activities in the EEA currently implicate the GDPR and if we undertake commercial operations in the EEA, offer products or services to individuals in the EEA, or monitor the behavior of individuals within the EEA, we will have additional compliance obligations.",
        "start_character": 131753,
        "end_character": 132027
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-114044",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-114044-99dd25c7964d93b4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-114044",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Some customers or other service providers may respond to these evolving laws and regulations by asking us to make certain privacy or data-related contractual commitments that we are unable or unwilling to make.",
        "start_character": 133276,
        "end_character": 133486
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-114044",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-114044-99dd25c7964d93b4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-114044",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our business model, we aim to provide portable MRI systems that are more affordable than conventional MRI systems and achieve our vision of increasing access to MRI systems at different sites of care worldwide.",
        "start_character": 65537,
        "end_character": 65755
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-114044",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-114044-99dd25c7964d93b4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-114044",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To help ensure our customers receive the highest level of customer service, we plan to continue to sell directly to customers and provide ongoing customer support.",
        "start_character": 65123,
        "end_character": 65286
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-114044",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-114044-99dd25c7964d93b4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-114044",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are primarily commercializing our device through one business model, which is ownership accompanied by an annual software, service and support agreement.",
        "start_character": 64358,
        "end_character": 64514
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-114044",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-114044-99dd25c7964d93b4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-114044",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We designed our Swoop® system to address an unmet need in accessible, affordable, portable medical imaging through a unique combination of hardware and AI-powered software services.",
        "start_character": 44258,
        "end_character": 44439
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-114044",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-114044-99dd25c7964d93b4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-114044",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We designed our product with the physician workflow in mind, reducing the average emergency department time to scan from 27.7 hours required for the conventional MRI process to a median time-to-scan of 2.5 hours with our Swoop® system.",
        "start_character": 18037,
        "end_character": 18272
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-114044",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-114044-99dd25c7964d93b4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-114044",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We generate sales revenue by selling the Swoop® system primarily through one business model, which is ownership accompanied by an annual software, service and support agreement.",
